  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROGRAMMATIC FISCAL AND INSTITUTIONAL STRUCTURAL ADJUSTMENT LOAN III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The government&apos;s fiscal and institutional reform agenda is supported by the Bank through the series of four single-tranche Fiscal and Institutional Adjustment Loans (FIAL).  The objectives of this series of loans are two: first, to promote reforms addressing fiscal rigidities necessary to attain the substantial fiscal adjustment underlying sustainable macroeconomic stability; and second, to improve the provision of public services and establish the institutional basis for higher efficiency and accountability in public expenditure.</narrative>
  </description>
